  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Accessibility Feature: Image Alternatives\r\n\r\n_Short text explains images so the gallery still makes sense when pictures don’t load or can’t be seen._\r\n\r\nChat with the AI to learn how image alternatives were implemented in this web app.\r\n\r\nPossible Stems:\r\n\r\n* Where do we put the short description for each product image? Tell me the exact attribute name.\r\n\r\n* Which images are missing a description? List them and suggest one clear sentence for each.\r\n\r\n* Write one good description for this product image (brand/item/color/pose). Keep it short and specific.\r\n\r\n* Give me one JS line to toggle show-descriptions on <body> when I click #descBtn.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "outline",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false,
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
        ""
      ],
      "freeResponseHeight": 50,
      "codeEditableAfterSubmit": false
    },
    "display_name": "Image Alternatives",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Short text or captions that stand in for pictures when they can’t be seen.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/e28d2636cbe200d00a9f35ae0d034ee8-aiChat.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Merch Gallery - Image Alternatives</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Merch Gallery</h1>\n  \n  <button id=\"toggle-btn\">Show Descriptions</button>\n  \n  <div class=\"gallery\">\n    <div class=\"product-card\">\n      <img src=\"hawaiian-shirt.png\" alt=\"\" />\n      <p class=\"caption hidden\">Hawaiian Shirt - Tropical print button-up</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"product-card\">\n      <img src=\"purple-dress-shirt.png\" alt=\"\" />\n      <p class=\"caption hidden\">Purple Dress Shirt - Classic formal wear</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n  const toggleBtn = document.querySelector(\"#toggle-btn\");\n  const captions = document.querySelectorAll(\".caption\");\n\n  toggleBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    captions[0].classList.toggle(\"hidden\");\n    captions[1].classList.toggle(\"hidden\");\n    \n    if (captions[0].classList.contains(\"hidden\")) {\n      toggleBtn.textContent = \"Show Descriptions\";\n    } else {\n      toggleBtn.textContent = \"Hide Descriptions\";\n    }\n  });\n});\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "body {\n  font-family: sans-serif;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  margin: 20px auto;\n  padding: 10px 20px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.gallery {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n\n.product-card {\n  margin-bottom: 30px;\n  border: 1px solid #ccc;\n  padding: 15px;\n  background: white;\n}\n\n.product-card img {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 300px;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n.caption {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #333;\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  visibility: hidden;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
